{"3695350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hounded", "steam_appid": 3695350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>dog-adventure game</strong> set in a <strong>Flintlock Fantasy</strong> world gripped by tyranny. You are <strong>Duke</strong>, a determined young <strong>Border Collie</strong> who is searching for their lost master, the leader of The Rebellion. <strong>Hounded</strong> by a cunning hunter, can you <strong>track</strong> the scent, <strong>unearth</strong> the power of The Tide and <strong>find</strong> your way home?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hounded is a touching tale of love, loss, hope and determination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695350/extras/8e517c41803a35ef4dd0c53b5aebdc28.avif?t=1779894696\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695350/extras_big/8e517c41803a35ef4dd0c53b5aebdc28.avif?t=1779894696 width=800 height=402 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As <strong>Duke</strong>, resting by the fire in a warm farmstead, your innocence is set ablaze when the oppressive regime destroys your home, separating you from your master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost, and alone, you venture deep into an unfamiliar land, using your heightened senses to search for him. Tracking his scent to the quaint village of Tideswell, all is not as it seems as you’ll unearth secrets, meeting friends and foes while discovering your latent connection to a supernatural energy called <strong>The Tide</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transformed, can you outsmart the opposition and reunite with your master before the regime catches up with them?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hounded is a <strong>third person</strong>, <strong>narrative adventure game</strong> where you play as a young <strong>Border Collie</strong> called Duke. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to use all of his canine agility to <strong>run, leap</strong> and <strong>climb</strong> his way through <strong>Angoldia</strong>, overcoming all of the obstacles in his way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695350/extras/9a5b179a49e60cd7017e424422f676f5.avif?t=1779894696\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695350/extras_big/9a5b179a49e60cd7017e424422f676f5.avif?t=1779894696 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duke has a keen nose making <strong>scent-based gameplay</strong> a core part of Duke's journey. Not only are you following your master's scent through the world, you will also find scents that lead you to <strong>secrets, puzzles</strong> and <strong>narrative</strong> moments trapped in time called <strong>Imprints.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695350/extras/0fd1648af7dbf2cccf1f1eaf51c6e2c1.avif?t=1779894696\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695350/extras_big/0fd1648af7dbf2cccf1f1eaf51c6e2c1.avif?t=1779894696 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout his quest, Duke will encounter an antagonist known only as <strong>The Hunter.</strong> This mysterious adversary appears at <strong>pivotal moments</strong> in Duke's journey, aiming to bring his quest to an <strong>early end</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695350/extras/db9d13642cd9d9813966d13da2928e8c.avif?t=1779894696\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695350/extras_big/db9d13642cd9d9813966d13da2928e8c.avif?t=1779894696 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hunter encounters will require a mix of <strong>stealth, platforming</strong> and <strong>problem solving</strong> to ensure that Duke can progress through these areas <strong>unscathed</strong>, and continue on with his mission to find his master.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Duke</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695350/extras/1f361614b6b777af5639e2c8d6c2b6d3.avif?t=1779894696\" width=746 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Little Duke</strong>, or <strong>Duke</strong> for short. Once a <strong>royal puppy</strong>, Duke isn't your usual protagonist. He is <strong>loyal, smart</strong>, extremely <strong>stubborn</strong>, and will do whatever it takes to <strong>protect the ones he loves</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hounded is being developed by <strong>IMPRNT STUDIOS</strong>, an independent UK-based game studio founded by ex Sony, TT Games, Cloud Imperium Games and Sega Developers, as well as a pack of supporting <strong>dogs</strong>!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>dog-adventure game</strong> set in a <strong>Flintlock Fantasy</strong> world gripped by tyranny. You are <strong>Duke</strong>, a determined young <strong>Border Collie</strong> who is searching for their lost master, the leader of The Rebellion. <strong>Hounded</strong> by a cunning hunter, can you <strong>track</strong> the scent, <strong>unearth</strong> the power of The Tide and <strong>find</strong> your way home?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hounded is a touching tale of love, loss, hope and determination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695350/extras/8e517c41803a35ef4dd0c53b5aebdc28.avif?t=1779894696\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695350/extras_big/8e517c41803a35ef4dd0c53b5aebdc28.avif?t=1779894696 width=800 height=402 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As <strong>Duke</strong>, resting by the fire in a warm farmstead, your innocence is set ablaze when the oppressive regime destroys your home, separating you from your master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost, and alone, you venture deep into an unfamiliar land, using your heightened senses to search for him. Tracking his scent to the quaint village of Tideswell, all is not as it seems as you’ll unearth secrets, meeting friends and foes while discovering your latent connection to a supernatural energy called <strong>The Tide</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transformed, can you outsmart the opposition and reunite with your master before the regime catches up with them?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hounded is a <strong>third person</strong>, <strong>narrative adventure game</strong> where you play as a young <strong>Border Collie</strong> called Duke. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to use all of his canine agility to <strong>run, leap</strong> and <strong>climb</strong> his way through <strong>Angoldia</strong>, overcoming all of the obstacles in his way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >