blem solving</strong> to ensure that Duke can progress through these areas <strong>unscathed</strong>, and continue on with his mission to find his master.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Duke</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695350/extras/1f361614b6b777af5639e2c8d6c2b6d3.avif?t=1779894696\" width=746 height=1080 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Little Duke</strong>, or <strong>Duke</strong> for short. Once a <strong>royal puppy</strong>, Duke isn't your usual protagonist. He is <strong>loyal, smart</strong>, extremely <strong>stubborn</strong>, and will do whatever it takes to <strong>protect the ones he loves</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hounded is being developed by <strong>IMPRNT STUDIOS</strong>, an independent UK-based game studio founded by ex Sony, TT Games, Cloud Imperium Games and Sega Developers, as well as a pack of supporting <strong>dogs</strong>!</p>", "short_description": "You are Duke, a determined young Border Collie who is searching for their lost master, the leader of The Rebellion. Hounded by a cunning hunter, can you track the scent, unearth the power of The Tide and find your way home?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695350/40a793f561c1d3dccb582dffdd2aabdd7b94d225/header.jpg?t=1779894696", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695350/44916e9e920c7920d052566ea71c3a9d35ec65fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779894696", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695350/44916e9e920c7920d052566ea71c3a9d35ec65fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779894696", "website": "https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/houndedgame/hounded", "pc_requirements":